avor-tag\">Sensa\u00e7\u00e3o</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Prest\u00edgio</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Casadinho</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Maracuj\u00e1</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Milho</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Lim\u00e3o</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Morangoninho</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Meio Amargo</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Caf\u00e9</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Napolitano</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Coco Queimado</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Cajuzinho</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Pa\u00e7oca</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"menu-card special-card\">\n<h2>Brigadeiros Especiais</h2>\n<div class=\"price-box\">\n<strong>Cento de Brigadeiros - R$ 220</strong>\n<span>Escolha at\u00e9 4 sabores</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"price-box\">\n<strong>Meio Cento de Brigadeiros - R$ 110</strong>\n<span>Escolha at\u00e9 2 sabores</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flavors-title\">Sabores dispon\u00edveis:</div>\n<div class=\"flavors-list\">\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Floresta Negra</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Floresta Branca</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Ninho com Nutella</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Surpresa de Uva</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Churros</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Doce de Leite</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Doce de Leite com Coco</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Olho de Sogra</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Oreo</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Ferrero</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Confete</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Nozes</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Cereja</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Romeu e Julieta</span>\n<span class=\"flavor-tag\">Bicho de P\u00e9 com Nutella</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"info-section\">\n<h3>Informa\u00e7\u00f5es de Pagamento</h3>\n<p>Para realizar seu pedido \u00e9 necess\u00e1rio pagar <strong>50% do valor</strong> do pedido ou o <strong>valor total</strong> antecip